## Holdfast

The Durable Work Continuity (DWC) capability adapts concepts from Holdfast, by
André Almeida.

- Source: https://github.com/AndreAlmeidaDC/holdfast
- Upstream version: 1.1.0
- Assessed commit: 6e4f09dbad22bca93918aeb6efcbb0c0aaddd494
- Adaptation version: 1.1.0-nirvana.1
- License: MIT

The upstream repository is not modified. The adaptation does not embed Holdfast
as a rigid product or copy the skill wholesale; DWC is an engine capability that
extends the canonical Run Kernel.
